  "description": "Model Context Protocol (MCP) server binding for Orleans.Lattice. Exposes the cluster's transport-agnostic API facades (state, data, backup, auth, replication, treeadmin) as MCP tools over the official ModelContextProtocol SDK, with permission-aware tool discovery, an authenticated fail-closed credential bridge, and a default-deny authorization posture. Registered with AddLatticeMcp(...) and mapped with MapLatticeMcp(); per-facade tool modules are opt-in via AddStateTools/AddDataTools/AddBackupTools/AddAuthTools/AddReplicationTools/AddTreeAdminTools, and out-of-silo hosting is available via AddLatticeMcpRemote(...).",
